{
  "name": "CEDIT 03 — Radar noticias MEF (8:00 diario)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📰 CEDIT — FLUJO 3\n\n**Programación:** todos los días a las **08:00** (hora del servidor n8n).\n\n**Qué hace:**\n1. Llama a FastAPI `POST /api/automation/mef-news/sync`\n2. Revisa enlaces nuevos en [Gob.pe MEF Noticias](https://www.gob.pe/institucion/mef/noticias)\n3. Si hay novedades → opcional aviso Discord\n\n**Requiere:** `uvicorn` en puerto **8000**.\n\n**Zona horaria:** define `TZ=America/Lima` al iniciar n8n si quieres 8:00 Perú.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "sticky-mef-news",
      "name": "📌 LEER — Radar MEF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-100, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule-8am",
      "name": "⏰ 08:00 diario",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [380, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "cedit/automation/mef-news",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-manual-sync",
      "name": "🌐 Webhook manual",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [380, 480],
      "webhookId": "cedit-mef-news-sync"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/automation/mef-news/sync",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ verify_urls: true, max_verify: 20, canal: 'n8n', triggered_at: $now.toISO() }) }}",
        "options": { "timeout": 180000 }
      },
      "id": "http-sync-mef",
      "name": "📡 FastAPI sync MEF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [640, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-new",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.new_count }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-ok",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-has-new",
      "name": "¿Noticias nuevas?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [900, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "log1",
              "name": "log",
              "value": "={{ 'CEDIT MEF: ' + $json.new_count + ' noticia(s) nueva(s), ' + $json.new_relevant_count + ' relevante(s) para inversión pública.' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "digest",
              "name": "digest",
              "value": "={{ $json.digest_markdown }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-digest",
      "name": "📝 Preparar digest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1140, 280]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.DISCORD_MEF_NEWS_WEBHOOK_URL }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ content: ($json.digest || '').slice(0, 1900) }) }}",
        "options": { "timeout": 30000 }
      },
      "id": "http-discord-optional",
      "name": "💬 Discord (opcional)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1380, 280],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "log0",
              "name": "log",
              "value": "={{ $json.ok ? 'CEDIT MEF: sin noticias nuevas (' + $json.listing_count + ' en listado).' : 'Error sync: ' + ($json.error || 'desconocido') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-no-new",
      "name": "📋 Log sin novedad",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1140, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Discord opcional\n\nVariable de entorno en n8n:\n`DISCORD_MEF_NEWS_WEBHOOK_URL`\n\nSi está vacía, el nodo falla en silencio (`continueOnFail`).\n\nPrueba manual:\n`POST http://localhost:5678/webhook/cedit/automation/mef-news`",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "sticky-discord",
      "name": "📌 Discord",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1320, 80]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "⏰ 08:00 diario": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "📡 FastAPI sync MEF", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "🌐 Webhook manual": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "📡 FastAPI sync MEF", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "📡 FastAPI sync MEF": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "¿Noticias nuevas?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "¿Noticias nuevas?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "📝 Preparar digest", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "📋 Log sin novedad", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "📝 Preparar digest": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "💬 Discord (opcional)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "timezone": "America/Lima"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": true
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "tags": [{ "name": "CEDIT" }, { "name": "MEF" }, { "name": "automation" }]
}
